# School deliverables (Liora)

Local refs (gitignored): `refs/`. Start with `refs/INDEX.md`. Do not commit those files.

Written deliverables (later): CDC, roadmap, technical report. Product code/docs stay English.

## Linker mapping (architecture steps)

| Step | Liora | Linker |
|------|--------|--------|
| 1 | Collect | Go scraper / fetcher / trending → `github.raw_*` |
| 2 | ETL | Dagster + dbt (`stg_`/`int_`/`fct_`/`match_*`) + Prisma/pgvector |
| 3 | Consume | Mistral classify, MiniLM embeddings, hybrid reco, ranker metrics. No MLflow. Dagster UI for runs; `GET /v1/dashboard` for reco KPIs |
| 4 | Prod | FastAPI `/v1` + Docker Compose |
| 5 | Infra | GitHub Actions + GHCR. Prometheus/Grafana in Compose (`observability/`). Terraform in `infra/terraform/` |

Fiches are **examples**, not the subject. X For You principles (retrieve → filter → score → top-K) apply to reco, not a Phoenix clone.
